  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "The table is a sample consultation plan: for each of the seven stages of developing the national eHealth vision (rows), it describes how decision-makers, key influencers, broader stakeholders and the general public (columns) would be consulted or involved.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
